######################################################################
# .what = vendor map: merchant pattern -> Form 1120 line + label
#
# .why  = which 1120 line a cost belongs on is a property of the COST,
#         not of the statement. as data, one entity's vendor set never
#         gets baked into the skill, and a reviewer can audit the line
#         assignments without a code read.
#
# .how  = one rule per line, three pipe-separated fields:
#
#           <ere pattern> | <1120 line> | <label>
#
#         patterns are matched case-insensitively, in file order, first
#         match wins. put narrow patterns above broad ones.
#
# .note = the pattern may itself carry "|" as ERE alternation, even though
#         "|" is also the field delimiter. fields are therefore read from
#         the RIGHT — last is the label, second-to-last the 1120 line, and
#         all that precedes them is the pattern. so this reads correctly:
#
#           WEWORK|REGUS|INDUSTRIOUS | 16 | shared office (rent)
#
#         the label and the line must never contain "|".
#
# .note = a merchant that matches no rule lands in `?? unclassified`.
#         that bucket is a TODO list, not a category — sweep it before
#         any return goes out.
#
# .the lines
#   16      rents
#   17      taxes and licenses
#   18      interest
#   20/cap  capital asset -> depreciate via Form 4562, do NOT expense
#   22      the "Advertising" line, per the 1120 label
#   26      other deductions (itemized on a statement)
######################################################################

# --- 22: promotion ---
GOOGLE ?\*ADS          | 22     | Google Ads
META PLATFORMS|FACEBK  | 22     | Meta Ads
LINKEDIN               | 22     | LinkedIn Ads
VISTAPRINT|STICKERAPP  | 22     | print/promo materials

# --- 16: rents ---
WEWORK|REGUS|INDUSTRIOUS | 16   | shared office (rent)

# --- 17: taxes and licenses ---
DELAWARE CORP ?& ?TAX  | 17     | DE franchise tax
REG AGENT|STRIPE ATLAS | 17     | Stripe Atlas (agent)
NORTHWEST REGISTERED   | 17     | registered agent

# --- 20/cap: capital assets (depreciate, do NOT expense) ---
DELL INC|LENOVO|NEWEGG | 20/cap | hardware

# --- 26: cloud + infra ---
AMAZON WEB SERVICES|AWS\. | 26  | AWS
GOOGLE ?CLOUD|GCP      | 26     | Google Cloud
AZURE|MICROSOFT AZURE  | 26     | Azure
FASTLY                 | 26     | Fastly
CLOUDFLARE             | 26     | Cloudflare
VERCEL                 | 26     | Vercel
HEROKU|RENDER\.COM     | 26     | PaaS
MONGODB|SUPABASE|NEON  | 26     | managed db

# --- 26: ai / llm ---
# .note = the card prints the PRODUCT name, not the vendor's legal name —
#         "CHATGPT SUBSCRIPTION" never contains "OPENAI", and "GROK XAI"
#         never matches "XAI LLC". match on what the statement prints.
ANTHROPIC|CLAUDE\.AI   | 26     | Anthropic
OPENAI|CHATGPT         | 26     | OpenAI
XAI LLC|GROK           | 26     | xAI
MIDJOURNEY             | 26     | Midjourney
FIREWORKS\.AI          | 26     | Fireworks AI

# --- 26: comms / api ---
TWILIO                 | 26     | Twilio
SENDGRID|POSTMARK|RESEND | 26   | email api
SLACK                  | 26     | Slack

# --- 26: dev tools / saas ---
GITHUB|GITLAB          | 26     | source hosts
APPLE ONLINE STORE|APPLE DEVELOPER | 26 | Apple Developer Program
ADOBE                  | 26     | Adobe
FIGMA                  | 26     | Figma
LOGROCKET|SENTRY|DATADOG | 26   | observability
LINEAR|NOTION           | 26     | product saas
STRIPE                 | 26     | Stripe fees
DROPBOX                | 26     | Dropbox
CANVA                  | 26     | design tools
GOOGLE ?\*PLAY         | 26     | Google Play

# .note = "GOOGLE ?\*DOMAINS" — the statement prints "GOOGLE *DOMAINS" WITH
#         a space before the asterisk, so a pattern without the optional
#         space silently misses every row. same trap as Google Ads.
# .note = Squarespace prints a unique invoice/domain id per charge
#         ("SQSP* DOMAIN#NNNNNNNNN"), so each charge looks like a distinct
#         merchant. match the SQSP*/SQUARESPACE stem, not the full string.
GOOGLE ?\*DOMAINS|NAMECHEAP|GODADDY | 26 | domains
SQSP ?\*|SQUARESPACE   | 26     | Squarespace (domains/site)
